   "id": "a2736b41-8e07-69d4-2192-ce7f54e14df8",
   "text": {
    "html": "<h6 class=\"heading-xsmall\">Pure Matcha Partners Hojicha is a roasted Japanese green tea powder made from organic leaves. <br data-w-id=\"d097aeaa-d7f7-8c01-8c9e-bcc3057625f3\"><br data-w-id=\"cfca3557-e819-9a90-a216-21fc4cb7d3c7\">With warm, nutty flavors and low caffeine, it’s ideal for hojicha lattes, baked goods, and dessert recipes. <br data-w-id=\"1dcaab9a-473d-1c1e-047b-3594f471b25f\"><br data-w-id=\"18f22f08-cf12-78f4-c72f-164cc5fbfa59\">A great wholesale option for cafés and culinary professionals looking for unique Japanese tea ingredients.<br data-w-id=\"956a5cc0-dcdf-70c1-de80-bf680161c5ae\"><br data-w-id=\"50d25246-3859-c090-3561-8802dd6d2548\">Available through our <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"698ed39e8999d2a9cf8e7e17\" data-w-id=\"559913a9-2135-637d-75b0-8f01a26d5321\">wholesale bulk supply programs</a>.</h6>",
    "text": "Pure Matcha Partners Hojicha is a roasted Japanese green tea powder made from organic leaves. \n\nWith warm, nutty flavors and low caffeine, it’s ideal for hojicha lattes, baked goods, and dessert recipes. \n\nA great wholesale option for cafés and culinary professionals looking for unique Japanese tea ingredients.\n\nAvailable through our wholesale bulk supply programs."
   },
   "attributes": {}
